This is an independently worded, illustrated learning adaptation, not the
official edition or a verbatim mirror. The source chapter organization and
technical explanations have been rewritten for readers with no AI or
programming background. New teaching examples, diagrams, review questions
and source-coverage notes have been added.

The first chapter is the user's existing article draft, with repository-local
image paths and an explicit publication-verification note. The supplied
WeChat publication must be checked for later changes before claiming exact
identity with the published article.

Original notices are retained. LICENSE contains the source project's
Apache License 2.0. Original images created for this learning adaptation
are distinguished from upstream experiment screenshots. No result in this
adaptation claims to reproduce all upstream experiments.
